      "name": "Innate Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The necrolyte's innate spellcasting ability is Intelligence. It can innately cast the following spells (spell save DC 16), requiring no material components: At will: <em>disguise self, false life, mage armor (self only)</em> 1/day: <em>animate dead</em></p>",
